      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "*sorry, started replying and seems I got distracted*\n\nhaha, it's all useful, isn't it \ud83d\ude09 \nAt the base level, it's always nice to have *something* to look back on if there is some kind of issue somewhere. \nAdditionally, Tim had wanted some kind of data on what shot in what wafer a die may have come from, it's difficult if something ever happens in the middle and you end up off by one or something, but it's in there anyways.",
